          "text": "Umwami aca aranezerwa cane, atanga itegeko ngo bamukure muri urwo rwobo rw’intare. Kandi bamaze gukura Daniyeli muri ico kinogo, nta n’agakwabu kari ku mubiri wiwe, kuko yizigiye Imana yiwe.",
          "type": "text",
